<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6429" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cănăcē</span></b> ,
			ēs, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κανάκη</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Daughter of Æolus</i>, <i>who</i>, <i>living in incest with her brother
				Macareus</i>, <i>bore a son to him</i>, <i>and was forced by her father to kill herself</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Ov. H.
			11</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Tr. 2,
			384</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>The name of a dog</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 3,
				217</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hyg. Fab. 181</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
